{"page":119,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:65","surah":5,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ أَنَّ أَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَٱتَّقَوْا۟ لَكَفَّرْنَا عَنْهُمْ سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ وَلَأَدْخَلْنَـٰهُمْ جَنَّـٰتِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If only the People of the Book would believe and be mindful of God, We would take away their sins and bring them into the Gardens of Delight.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَهْلَ","en_gloss":"(the) People","transliteration":"ahla","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"(had) believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱتَّقَوْا۟","en_gloss":"and feared (Allah)","transliteration":"wa-ittaqaw","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَكَفَّرْنَا","en_gloss":"surely We (would have) removed","transliteration":"lakaffarnā","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their evil (deeds)","transliteration":"sayyiātihim","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَأَدْخَلْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"and surely We (would have) admitted them","transliteration":"wala-adkhalnāhum","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":11,"ar":"جَنَّـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(to) Gardens","transliteration":"jannāti","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلنَّعِيمِ","en_gloss":"(of) Bliss","transliteration":"l-naʿīmi","verse_key":"5:65"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٦٥","en_gloss":"(65)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:65"}]},{"verse_key":"5:66","surah":5,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ أَنَّهُمْ أَقَامُوا۟ ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ وَٱلْإِنجِيلَ وَمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْهِم مِّن رَّبِّهِمْ لَأَكَلُوا۟ مِن فَوْقِهِمْ وَمِن تَحْتِ أَرْجُلِهِم ۚ مِّنْهُمْ أُمَّةٌ مُّقْتَصِدَةٌ ۖ وَكَثِيرٌ مِّنْهُمْ سَآءَ مَا يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If they had upheld the Torah and the Gospel and what was sent down to them from their Lord, they would have been given abundance from above and from below: some of them are on the right course, but many of them do evil.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"that they","transliteration":"annahum","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَقَامُوا۟","en_gloss":"had stood firmly","transliteration":"aqāmū","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ","en_gloss":"(by) the Taurat","transliteration":"l-tawrāta","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْإِنجِيلَ","en_gloss":"and the Injeel","transliteration":"wal-injīla","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"was revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَيْهِم","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَّبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَأَكَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"surely they (would have) eaten","transliteration":"la-akalū","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَوْقِهِمْ","en_gloss":"above them","transliteration":"fawqihim","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَمِن","en_gloss":"and from","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَحْتِ","en_gloss":"beneath","transliteration":"taḥti","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَرْجُلِهِم ۚ","en_gloss":"their feet","transliteration":"arjulihim","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"Among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"5:66"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أُمَّةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a co